  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 97,
    "summary": "The Lord reigns in millennial glory—The hills melt at His presence—Those who love the Lord hate evil.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "The Lord reigneth; let the earth rejoice; let the multitude of isles be glad thereof.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 9,
            "end": 17,
            "text": "1 Chr. 16:31."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 77,
            "end": 85
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Clouds and darkness are round about him: righteousness and judgment are the habitation of his throne.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 11,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 8:12."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 23
          },
          {
            "start": 68,
            "end": 71
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "A fire goeth before him, and burneth up his enemies round about.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "His lightnings enlightened the world: the earth saw, and trembled.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 15,
            "end": 26,
            "text": "Ps. 77:18."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The hills melted like wax at the presence of the Lord, at the presence of the Lord of the whole earth.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 10,
            "end": 16,
            "text": "Judg. 5:5; Nahum 1:5."
          },
          {
            "start": 22,
            "end": 25,
            "text": "Ps. 68:2; Micah 1:4."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "The heavens declare his righteousness, and all the people see his glory.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 12,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "Ps. 50:6."
          },
          {
            "start": 24,
            "end": 37,
            "text": "Ps. 4:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Confounded be all they that serve graven images, that boast themselves of idols: worship him, all ye gods.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 10,
            "text": "Jacob 7:8 (6–15)."
          },
          {
            "start": 41,
            "end": 47,
            "text": "Ex. 20:4."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 98,
            "end": 100
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Zion heard, and was glad; and the daughters of Judah rejoiced because of thy judgments, O Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 34,
            "end": 43,
            "text": "Ps. 48:11."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "For thou, Lord, art high above all the earth: thou art exalted far above all gods.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 20,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "Ps. 83:18."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 16,
            "end": 19
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Ye that love the Lord, hate evil: he preserveth the souls of his saints; he delivereth them out of the hand of the wicked.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 23,
            "end": 27,
            "text": "TG Hate."
          },
          {
            "start": 28,
            "end": 32,
            "text": "TG Evil."
          },
          {
            "start": 37,
            "end": 47,
            "text": "Ps. 121:7; 145:20 (1–21); 1 Ne. 17:35 (33–35); D&C 82:10 (8–10)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Light is sown for the righteous, and gladness for the upright in heart.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 5,
            "text": "D&C 50:24."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Rejoice in the Lord, ye righteous; and give thanks at the remembrance of his holiness.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 7,
            "text": "TG Joy."
          },
          {
            "start": 44,
            "end": 50,
            "text": "D&C 59:21."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
